The refactor tool is not available, so I will write the test as is, without overriding LoadAssemblies. I will create a test subclass of PluginManager that exposes a method to call LoadAssemblies and override ChangePluginState to track calls. I will mock ILogger to verify LogError calls.

I will submit a test file with xUnit tests that cover the error logging on assembly load failure (FileLoadException and general Exception) and on assembly.GetTypes failure (TypeLoadException and general Exception). I will create minimal stubs for LocalPlugin and related types to simulate the scenarios.

