The PluginManifest.cs file is not found, but PluginStatus enum is in MediaBrowser.Model.Plugins namespace. I will add a minimal stub for PluginManifest with a Status property of type PluginStatus in the test file and add the using directive for MediaBrowser.Model.Plugins.

I will submit a revised test file with these changes and the previous test for LogError on FileLoadException during assembly loading. I will also simplify the test by creating a minimal LocalPlugin class with the needed properties to avoid reflection complexity.

